5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Good day to you all. Let us approach this trial with calm hearts and open minds. Trust is a fragile thing, but it is the only bridge to our victory.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's keep things logical.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"Oh, such a serious start! Let's have a little fun while we figure out who the big bad wolf is, shall we? I'm sure we'll find them soon.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I hope we can find a peaceful resolution to this situation.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited! I'll find the werewolf in no time! Hehe, maybe I'll play a little prank on them first!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Youthful energy is a blessing, Sakura. However, remember that patience is the key to wisdom. Let us listen to one another carefully.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
