13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I believe it is best to observe for a while. Silence often reveals more than words.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Jonathan, that's so mysterious! You sound like a detective in a movie! I want to be a detective too!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,Observation is indeed a virtue. Let us see how the night unfolds and what the morning light brings to our understanding.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
