31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"The sun rises again. I hope everyone slept peacefully. If the Seer has found a path to the truth, I encourage them to guide us gently.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's see if anyone has information to share.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"Morning, everyone! I slept like a baby. Now, who's going to be the first to spill some secrets? Don't be shy!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have spent some time reflecting. While I cannot reveal everything yet, I believe we can trust Servas.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,Good morning! I had a dream about a big fluffy wolf! Maybe it was a hint! Do you think the wolf is actually fluffy?,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Jonathan, your kindness is appreciated. However, trust should be earned through consistency. Let us look for contradictions in our words.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, dreams aren't evidence. We should focus on the behavior of the players.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're such a killjoy! But you're right. @Jonathan, you're very quick to trust Servas. That's almost... suspicious, isn't it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I simply value the peace he brings to the conversation.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, you're so mean to Misaki! But wait, maybe Jonathan and Servas are secret besties! That would be a funny twist!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki"",""Jonathan"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Laughter is a wonderful medicine, but we must not let it distract us from the task at hand. Does anyone feel an intuition about another?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I don't have a strong feeling yet. I'm still observing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"I'm starting to think Sakura is too excited. It's almost like she's trying to hide something behind all that energy. What do you think, @Sakura?","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I find Sakura's spirit refreshing. I do not believe she is the one we seek.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Eh?! @May, I'm just happy! I can't help it! I'm a professional at being excited! You're the one acting like a sneaky cat!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,Let us not let accusations turn into anger. We must vote with a clear conscience. I will trust the collective wisdom of the group.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll vote based on who seems the least consistent.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"I'll go with my gut. It's usually right, and it's telling me someone here is playing a very clever game.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,I will cast my vote for the sake of the village's safety.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm gonna vote for the person who's the most suspicious! Hehe, this is just like a real mystery!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
